# Purpose: This program allows the user to play hangman, consisting of 10, 6 letter words. The player will be notified if they lose or win,
# and will be prompted if they want to play with another word.
#---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------  
#HEADS UP!! The code will sometimes act up if you enter the same correct letters multiple times, so try to avoid doing so. It should work otherwise.

